__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
reports/*/
!reports/.gitkeep
# fx_correlation is the exception: the user wants its latest backtest/conviction
# output committed and visible on GitHub, not just regenerable locally (see
# DECISIONS.md D008). Other strategies' reports/ stay ignored by default.
!reports/fx_correlation/
!reports/fx_correlation/**
.venv/
*.egg-info/
strategies/*/data/cache/
